    "body": "## DUNCAN PRIME — W01 EXECUTION SURFACE CAPABILITY DELTA\n\n**RESULT**\n`PRODUCTION_CAPABLE_SOURCE_BOUND_EDITOR = AVAILABLE_ON_EXISTING_HOME_PC_SURFACE`\n\nThis supersedes the narrower current-runtime blocker recorded in #251 `5494007099` / #249 `5493980288`. The Linux chat runtime remains incapable, but Integration has now proven an already-existing capable Windows execution surface without installing software or creating a new runner/framework.\n\n**FRESH EVIDENCE**\n- existing private executor: `Lester-Sparx/zorr-blatt-local-executor`\n- bounded draft probe PR: `Lester-Sparx/zorr-blatt-local-executor#12`\n- exact probe HEAD: `3d706b334cfdd36c2d74a54a81b02a296f997867`\n- workflow run: `33547991863`\n- completed job: `99990163370` / `comfyui-surface-probe = SUCCESS`\n- runner: `HOME-PC-COMFYUI`, machine `HOME-PC`\n- probe mode: READ_ONLY; INSTALL=NO; SOURCE_EDIT=NO; GENERIC_COMMAND_INGRESS=NO\n- `COMFYUI_ROOT = FOUND` at existing `D:\\BLATT2\\ComfyUI_windows_portable\\ComfyUI`\n- mature editors physically found at fixed paths:\n  - `C:\\Program Files\\Krita (x64)\\bin\\krita.exe`\n  - `C:\\Program Files\\OpenToonz\\OpenToonz.exe`\n  - `C:\\Program Files\\Blender Foundation\\Blender 4.4\\blender.exe`\n\n**STATE**\n- `SOURCE_FREEZE = PASS` remains consumed from prior independent QC.\n- `SOURCE_RECOVERY_BLOCKER = CLOSED`; do not restart source search.\n- `W01 = FAIL-CLOSED / NOT EXECUTED ON CAPABLE SURFACE`.\n- `#248 = OPEN / NOT PASS`.\n- W02..W06, POSE, CAMERA, S001 remain closed.\n- PR #252 remains verification-only.\n\n**FIRST REAL BLOCKER NOW**\n`EXACT_FROZEN_C00_PIXELS_NOT_YET_PROVEN_CONSUMED_AS_EDIT_TARGET_ON_HOME_PC_CAPABLE_SURFACE`.\n\nThis is an execution-surface binding/injection proof, NOT source recovery.\n\n**NEXT LEGAL STEP**\nUse the already-verified frozen C00 source bytes on the existing HOME-PC capable surface and perform a bounded no-redesign open/consume proof in one mature editor (prefer existing Krita for direct raster source binding). Only after exact byte/hash binding is proven may VISUAL execute **W01 ARM_RAISE ONLY**. Then persist output SHA256 + full W01 matrix and STOP for independent CHAT C QC.\n\nNo install, no new framework/runner/editor architecture, no source rediscovery, no image_gen, no W02+, no main/canon mutation.",
